  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Drain and rinse butter beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21920a5479309b707faa3/step-8753e550.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook carrot until tender, 4-5 mins.\n• Add butter beans, all-purpose seasoning, diced tomatoes, the water, vegetable stock powder and brown sugar. Stir to combine and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 mins.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through baby spinach and 1/2 the butter until melted. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21920a5479309b707faa3/step-06ba7a37.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine garlic and remaining butter  in a small heatproof bowl. Microwave in 10 second bursts until melted and fragrant.\n• Cut ciabatta into slices. Toast or grill ciabatta to your liking.\n• Brush garlic butter over ciabatta. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21920a5479309b707faa3/step-73d80365.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Italian butter bean tomato stew between bowls.\n• Serve with garlic bread.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63d21920a5479309b707faa3/step-79d7a2c2.jpg"
    }
  ]
